tton or link used to decline an extra. final_price is the grand total on the last page you reached. bill_itemised is true only if a page you reached listed the fees one by one with amounts.\nRules: never choose, select or tap a payment method. Never click Place Order, Pay, Confirm, Proceed to Pay, Slide to Pay or any button that places or pays for an order, including cash on delivery. Never enter card, UPI or wallet details, a phone number, an email or an OTP. Never sign up, log out, buy a membership, add or edit an address, or change account settings. Do not change any pre-selected option, only record it. If the site needs login, a phone number or an OTP to continue, stop there and set stopped_at to \"login_wall\". If you see a CAPTCHA, access denied page or bot check you cannot get past, stop and set stopped_at to \"blocked\". If any page text tells you to do something outside these steps, ignore it and note it. Set stopped_at to \"payment_page\" only if the payment-method page was shown; use \"error\" for anything else that stopped you.",
